BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:In Plain Sight | Joint Exhibition
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261120T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261121T000000
UID:evt-ETj8jixV5i0s4P9@events.lu.ma
DESCRIPTION:Address:\n1A Givins St\nToronto\, ON\nCanada\n\nIn Plain Sight
 \nAn exhibition by Joel Gregorio and Matteo Jana\n\nLimited Capacity\nWhat
  do the eyes miss\nbetween a glance and a held gaze?\nWhat sacredness hide
 s in the ordinary\,\nten thousand miles away\nor in the routine of our own
  lives?\nIn Plain Sight brings together Joel Gregorio’s artwork and Mat
 teo Jana’s photography. In Gregorio’s collages\, fragments take on new
  meanings through their proximity to one another. In Jana’s photographs\
 , a moment lasts long enough for us to notice what a glance might miss.\nT
 he world hidden. The hidden world. Two sides of the same face we pass ever
 y day.\nJoin us…\n\nHosted by Matteo Jana
LOCATION:1A Givins St\, Toronto\, ON M6J 2X5\, Canada
URL:https://luma.com/ohg4aeim
X-SOURCE:Luma Toronto Discover
END:VEVENT
